sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports local cost calculation by CS
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.Enabled[Tariff] = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.MaxElements[Tariff] > 0
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to set a default tariff on EVSE 0.

    CSMS->>CS: SetDefaultTariffRequest (evseId = 0, tariff.tariffId)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId 0<br>tariff.tariffId must be <not omitted>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetDefaultTariffResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to clear only the tariff set in step 1.

    CSMS->>CS: ClearTariffsRequest (tariffIds[0] = tariffId of step 1)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: tariffIds[0] must be<br><SetDefaultTariffRequest.tariff.tariffId of step 1>
    CS-->>CSMS: ClearTariffsResponse (clearTariffsResult[0].tariffId = tariffId of step 1, clearTariffsResult[0].status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to clear all tariffs.

    CSMS->>CS: ClearTariffsRequest (tariffIds omitted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: tariffIds must be <omitted>
    CS-->>CSMS: ClearTariffsResponse (clearTariffsResult[0].tariffId omitted, clearTariffsResult[0].status = NoTariff)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
